{"id":"633533","name":"凉拌茄子","author":"Hhxj","authorId":"12848515","desc":"","cover":"images/633533/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"5个"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"少许"},{"name":"干红辣椒","amount":"3个"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1根"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"4瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备的食材如上。","img":"images/633533/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茄子是老妈地里摘的，冲洗一下即可，切去两端，再从中间切两段，放在蒸屉里。","img":"images/633533/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大火上锅蒸12分钟。","img":"images/633533/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒸茄子的空隙，切好葱花，辣椒圈，蒜瓣。","img":"images/633533/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"碗里放入1小勺盐。","img":"images/633533/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小勺白糖。","img":"images/633533/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入1大勺禾然有机糙米醋。","img":"images/633533/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大勺六月鲜轻盐昆布酱油。","img":"images/633533/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入适量开水拌匀。","img":"images/633533/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒸好的茄子用筷子戳进去即可。","img":"images/633533/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把茄子夹在盘里，用筷子从中间分成两半，再从中间分开。","img":"images/633533/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"分成粗状的条条。","img":"images/633533/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"撒上一半的葱花。","img":"images/633533/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"热锅放入猪油。","img":"images/633533/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入蒜瓣炒香。","img":"images/633533/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再放入辣椒圈。","img":"images/633533/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"倒入调料汁烧开即可。","img":"images/633533/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"淋在茄子上。","img":"images/633533/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"再放上剩余的葱花。","img":"images/633533/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"撒上白芝麻即可享用。","img":"images/633533/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"来一口吧，超级好吃。","img":"images/633533/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/633533/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"凉拌茄子用猪油超香，小时候的味道，试试吧！ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}